# Simplified Chinese (zh-CN) catalog for copilot_ui (GitHub Copilot sign-in and
# configuration UI).
#
# Product names (Zed, GitHub, Copilot, Copilot Chat) are deliberately left
# untranslated. `an-error-happened`, `cancel`, `copied`, `copy`, `error-error`,
# `sign-in`, `sign-out` are reused from other catalogs.

## Toasts

signing-out-of-copilot-edit-predictions = 正在退出 Copilot 编辑预测登录…
signed-out-of-copilot-edit-predictions = 已退出 Copilot 编辑预测登录
copilot-edit-predictions-is-reinstalling = Copilot 编辑预测正在重新安装…
copilot-edit-predictions-is-starting = Copilot 编辑预测正在启动…
copilot-edit-predictions-has-started = Copilot 编辑预测已启动。
starting-product = 正在启动 { $product }…
signing-into-product = 正在登录 { $product }…

